<ptxt>Inspect Toll Collection Antenna Wire</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Toll Collection Antenna Wire Installation Condition Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Inspect the toll collection antenna wire cord for installation problems such as sharp bends or pinching.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Measurement</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101146J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector connected to the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration that is connected to the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the toll collection antenna wire between the navigation antenna assembly and toll collection (ETC) computer assembly.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
